{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryOnCast"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Retries the upstream "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" up to a specified number of times only when a specific error occurs."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"retry"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"retries"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Su","text":"UInt"},{"kind":"text","text":" = 1, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"on"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"error"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO","text":"AsyncSequences"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/RetryOn","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7RetryOnC","text":"RetryOn"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/RetryByCountStrategy","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent20RetryByCountStrategyC","text":"RetryByCountStrategy"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"E"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentif